      "excerpt": "CBIC, Government of India :: Home Attention This Tab “ACES Archives” displays web content as was available in the erstwhile www.aces.gov.in and for information only. For all transactions under Central Excise and Service Tax use the Tab “ACES (CE&ST) Login” OK Attention You are being redirected to an external website. It will open in a new tab. Do you want to continue? Cancel Continue May I help you? From August 1st 2025 onwards, CBIC Mitra Helpdesk number will be 1800 425 0232 For any queries an",
