      "excerpt": "LEARN GERMAN Learn German Toggle navigation Home Placement Test Beginners Fortgeschrittene Profis Artikeltrainer Vocabulary Overview Grammar Overview Vocabulary Trainer Help Language My Profile Login Logout Learn German free online With Deutsche Welle's mobile courses, you can learn German easily and free of charge. Whether you are a beginner or highly proficient, this is where you will find German courses. You can also learn German with the news or music - from level A1 to C1. For German teache",
