      "checked_at": "2026-10-28T08:43:59+00:00",
      "text": "LEARN GERMAN Learn German Toggle navigation Home Placement Test Beginners Fortgeschrittene Profis Artikeltrainer Vocabulary Overview Grammar Overview Vocabulary Trainer Help Language My Profile Login Logout Learn German free online With Deutsche Welle's mobile courses, you can learn German easily and free of charge. Whether you are a beginner or highly proficient, this is where you will find German courses. You can also learn German with the news or music - from level A1 to C1. For German teachers there are teaching materials and the latest on German language teaching. We want to hear from you! DW would like to further develop its German-learning resources. We’d like to know: How do you learn German, and what do you think of this new idea? Click here for the survey! Find the right course for you A1, A2 | Basic users B1, B2 | Independent users C1, C2 | Proficient users For teachers New every day: our latest content Proteinprodukte: ein gefährlicher Trend? Immer mehr Jugendliche greifen zu Proteinprodukten. Doch wie viel Eiweiß brauchen sie und welche Risiken gibt es? B1 | 27.10.2026 Martin Luther – der Musiker und Liederdichter Luthers Glaubenslieder verhalfen der Reformation mit zum Durchbruch. C1 | 27.10.2026 Wenn der Kühlschrank zur Bedrohung wird Digitale Saugroboter, Kühlschränke oder Fernseher: Was passiert, wenn KI-Würmer das System angreifen? B1 | 23.10.2026 Warum manche Menschen ihren Sarg selbst bauen Viele Menschen denken nicht gern an den Tod. Doch die Arbeit am eigenen Sarg kann helfen, Berührungsängste abzubauen. B2 | 21.10.2026 Fast-Tech und das Problem mit dem Müll Sie kosten wenig, gehen schnell kaputt und landen dann im Müll: Fast-Tech-Geräte. B1 | 20.10.2026 Volkskrankheiten Allergien Ob Pollen oder Hausstaub – viele Menschen reagieren auf bestimmte Stoffe allergisch. Ein Allheilmittel gibt es nicht. C1 | 20.10.2026 Nicos Weg now available in Kiswahili! The new language version is still under development and will be ready soon. Staff picks Nicos Weg Follow Nico from Spain on his adventure in Germany. Video course for beginners with detailed grammar pages A1 Deutschtrainer Vocabulary and short sentences on 100 everyday topics: practice vocabulary and pronunciation with bilingual audios! A1 Deine Band Learn German with pop songs by the band ok.danke.tschüss. Videos with subtitles and interactive exercises. A2 Deine Deutschprüfung From A1 to C2: Here you will learn about exams with which you can officially prove your German language skills. New offers (in German only) Der Artikeltrainer Der, die, das: Use the Artikeltrainer to practice German articles and improve your German in a fun way. A1 Kurz und leicht The daily news on video: Train your listening comprehension with the latest video news at beginner level A2 Profis gesucht – Deutsch im Job Get linguistically fit for the job! Discover specific professions and get tips on typical communication situations. B1 Footer DW Learn German Who we are in German Partner in German Service Newsletter in German Podcasts in German Contact Follow us on © 2026 Deutsche Welle | Privacy Policy | Legal notice | Declaration on accessibility | Data privacy settings",
