y classification. Pricing tiers are aligned to the World Bank country classification system and applied consistently across regions. This approach supports clear and transparent pricing for learners worldwide. Please check here to find your country’s classification. Find out more » Apply now » International Certificate in Financial Services Risk Management (Level 5) Withdrawn from the RQF. Find out more » International Certificate in Operational Risk Management (Level 4) The pricing for this course follows a tiered structure based on country classification. Pricing tiers are aligned to the World Bank country classification system and applied consistently across regions. This approach supports clear and transparent pricing for learners worldwide. Please check here to find your country’s classification. 3-6 months (Depending on when the student enrols) 9 Units (150 hours TQT) Find out more » Apply now » * List of low GDP countries include New Awards Duration How Much does it cost? Next steps IRM Award in Managing AI Risks in the Workplace 1-4 Months 1 Unit (30 hours in total) The pricing for this award follows a tiered structure based on country classification. Pricing tiers are aligned to the World Bank country classification system and applied consistently across regions. This approach supports clear and transparent pricing for learners worldwide. Please check here to find your country’s classification. Enrol now » View full course syllabus » IRM Award in Financial Services Risk Management 2-4 Months 3 Units (90 hours in total) The pricing for this award follows a tiered structure based on country classification. Pricing tiers are aligned to the World Bank country classification system and applied consistently across regions. This approach supports clear and transparent pricing for learners worldwide. Please check here to find your country’s classification. Enrol now » View full course syllabus » IRM Award in Managing Organisational Risks 1-4 Months 1 Unit (30 hours